graph TD
    A([Transforms Layer]) --> E[ForecastingModel]
    B([Models Layer]) --> E
    C([Explainability Layer]) --> F

    A --> A1(validation; general)
    A --> A2(time; weather; energy)

    B --> B1[XGBoostForecaster]
    B1 -->|delegates to| E

    C --> C1[ExplainableForecaster]
    C --> C2[ContributionsMixin]
    C1 -->|decorates via mixin| F[Decorated Forecaster]

    E -->|composes transforms| F

    classDef primary fill:#00D9C5,stroke:#1E3A5F,stroke-width:2px,color:#000
    classDef secondary fill:#1E3A5F,stroke:#00D9C5,stroke-width:2px,color:#fff
    classDef accent fill:#e6f7f5,stroke:#00D9C5,stroke-width:2px,color:#000

    class A,B,C primary
    class E,F secondary
    class A1,A2,B1,C1,C2 accent